(text "THAT 1646 = +6 dB cross-coupled driver. A TS plug on the output shorts Out- to ground; OutSmarts keeps the full signal on the tip.\n10 uF non-polar sense caps (datasheet figure 5) drop output DC offset from 250 mV to 15 mV. 10 R build-outs isolate cable capacitance.\nOutput jack switch contacts are not used." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 33.02 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0224ad45-fbc2-4f90-9e3b-a1924f5712da"))
(text "Bypass, one per supply pin, within 5 mm of U6 / U7. C42, C43 bulk for the output side." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 200.66 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e2c723d1-82b8-48c8-9340-e0f2dc827923"))
